    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is, even if i let the grief wash over me, it doesn't change the fact that he's gone. and honestly? it's not just him. it feels like everything is just... gone. like the world is this big, loud, meaningless place and i'm just stuck here in this quiet house alone. i feel like i'm just going through the motions for no reason at all. what's the point of staying in this cycle of losing things?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
